    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. when u say \"unpredictability\" in nigeria, do u mean like actual logistical issues or more like the people? i'm just trying to figure out if it's a risk of delays or if it's more about being able to trust that the contracts will actually be honored there. like, is it common for things to go sideways because of how business is done in that region?",
