      "content": "The \"unpredictability\" in Nigeria often stems from a combination of factors, including infrastructure challenges and a business culture that can be less rigidly formal than in other places. While logistical issues are certainly a factor, there can also be a cultural tendency towards relationship-based dealings rather than strict adherence to written contracts alone. You should anticipate that navigating business there requires a high degree of personal relationship building and flexibility to handle unexpected turns.",
